    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "On 0cf6368d the policy mostly passed across many retimings and delays. Its one failure, at -1 s, 1.25x and 250 ms, was another left drift, into a stopped car in the left lane. On 09a95ffa at -2 s, 0.75x and 350 ms, a car coming up from behind sideswiped the ego, and triage could not say whether the policy was at fault.",
